## [Items](items)

### [a Kralien route chart](clue_chart)
---
Type: item/quest
Art: unknown
---
A route chart, cut into a plate that has outlasted everyone who read it. It marks the relay
they ran to - and the way IN to it, which is not the way anything approaches from open
space.

### [deep salvage](ash_salvage)
---
Type: item/salvage
Art: unknown
Price: 240
---
Whatever they were mining here, they were mining it a long way down and they left in a
hurry. Eddy will ask where you got it.

## [Relics](relics)

### [The Ash Warren](ash_warren)
---
Atmosphere: red
Containment: tractor
Scrape band: 160
Margin: 90
Forbid jump: yes
Seed: 51
Art: plain_asteroid_6, plain_asteroid_9, plain_asteroid_10
---
A warren bored into a rock in the ash fields. No hand squared anything off in here; every
room is round because round is what you get when you dig.

### [the bore](bore)
---
Relic: ash_warren
Chamber: -2600, 0, 0, 700
---
The way in. Wide enough, if you are careful and slow.

