---
Three ways on. Two of them are full of rock.

### [the deep cut](deep)
---
Relic: ash_warren
Chamber: 1800, -1600, 900, 900
Passage to: crossing 400
---
Down and over. Whatever they were following, they followed it here.

### [the last room](last)
---
Relic: ash_warren
Chamber: 2600, -2600, 1900, 800
Passage to: deep 380
---
And this is where they stopped, turned round, and left.

### [the fall](fall_solid)
---
Relic: ash_warren
Solid: sphere, 300, -100, -600, 420
---
The roof of the crossing came down. Off to one side of the room, deliberately: a slab on
the CENTRE would sit exactly where every passage into the room meets, and that is not an
obstacle to fly around, it is a door that will not open.

### [the wedge](wedge_solid)
---
Relic: ash_warren
Solid: capsule, 1400, -1300, 1600, 2200, -1900, 1900, 200
---
A slab across one side of the deep cut, at an angle. Off the room's centre for the
same reason the fall is: the centre is where the passages meet.

